```
calories, fat_total_g, fat_saturated_g, cholesterol_mg, sodium_mg,
carbohydrates_total_g, fiber_g, sugar_g, protein_g,
vitamin_d_mcg, calcium_mg, iron_mg, potassium_mg
```

